Air Bed and Breakfast

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:13.470
but I was like you know screw this,

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:14.380
let's try to start something.

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:16.888
So I started a roommate matching
app that had a small exit

00:03:16.888 --> 00:03:19.780
and then kind of parlayed
that into The Hustle

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:21.650
and what I'm doing now.

00:03:21.650 --> 00:03:22.810
- And what was that company called

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:23.660
and who'd it sell to?

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:25.916
- It was called Bunk originally, Bunk SF.

00:03:25.916 --> 00:03:29.250
So what we would do is,
it was kind of funny,

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:31.444
we would cold email all these
landlords and apartments

00:03:31.444 --> 00:03:34.268
who had two three, four,
five bedroom apartments

00:03:34.268 --> 00:03:36.140
and then we would host parties

00:03:36.140 --> 00:03:37.980
so people who had similar wants and needs

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:40.226
for living situations
could all meet one another

00:03:40.226 --> 00:03:43.080
and we would help them
move into these buildings

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:45.557
and we would take a small
cut of like a placement fee

00:03:45.557 --> 00:03:47.280
and so it was a small exit

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:48.740
like hundreds of thousands of dollars

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:51.050
to Apartment Lists, apartmentlists.com.

00:03:51.050 --> 00:03:52.800
