in that company or no?

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:54.630
- Yeah and I quit on the--

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:57.320
- The first day you could.
- 366 or whatever it was.

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:58.600
Yeah, like that last day.

00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:00.534
