00:04:41.569 --> 00:04:42.402
- Just like leveling up.

00:04:42.402 --> 00:04:45.455
Okay, so you guys have
a great set up here.

00:04:45.455 --> 00:04:47.780
You started in like a
small room I imagine,

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:48.620
